# build outputs
node_modules/
dist/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/WixTools/
src-tauri/gen/

# Community visualization-plugin content (ISF shaders, Milkdrop presets) belongs only in
# the user's local app-data folder (~/.local/share/com.cuemark.app/visualizations/), never
# in this repo — per-file licenses in a downloaded pack are often unclear or unstated (see
# docs/design/visualization-plugins.md's "Preset formats" section). This is belt-and-suspenders:
# nothing in the normal workflow writes these paths inside the repo, but guard against an
# accidental drop-in anyway.
/visualizations/
/plugins/milkdrop/
*.milk
